Package: biogeoshiny
Title: BioGeoBEARS Shiny Application for Ancestral Range Estimation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Manus", "AI", email = "manus@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A comprehensive Rshiny application for ancestral range estimation 
    using BioGeoBEARS, with integrated range extrapolation methods and export 
    capabilities for NDM, TNT, and NEXUS formats. Designed in the style of 
    Wallace 2 for user-friendly biogeographic analysis.
